# Welcome to Our Documentation

This is the introduction page for our documentation site.

## Features

- Built with SvelteKit
- Fully i18n compatible
- Uses MDsveX for Markdown rendering
- Beautiful styling with TailwindCSS

## Getting Started

To navigate through the documentation, use the sidebar on the left. Select a topic to learn more about our product and how to use it effectively.

Feel free to [contact us](mailto:support@example.com) if you have any questions that aren't answered in the documentation.